Project name: DailyFlow

Project overview:
DailyFlow is a web application that helps users manage schedule, routines, meals, workouts, and wellbeing in one place.

Core product areas:
- onboarding questionnaire
- calendar screen
- workouts
- meals and grocery planning
- stress and break recommendations
- overview / weekly summary
- profile settings

Main stack and infrastructure:
- Frontend: React + Vite
- Backend: Python on AWS Lambda
- Authentication: Amazon Cognito
- Database: DynamoDB
- Hosting: AWS Amplify
- External integration: Google Calendar
- User-uploaded assets: Amazon S3
- AI integration: OpenAI

Existing DynamoDB tables:
- Users
  - PK: user_id
- Integrations
  - PK: user_id
- BusyBlocks
  - PK: user_id
  - SK: block_key
- DailyFlowEvents
  - PK: user_id
  - SK: event_id
- WorkoutLibrary
  - PK: user_id
- MealsAndGroceries
  - PK: user_id
  - SK: record_key
- StressBreaksLibrary
  - PK: user_id

